d v4: 8/10 fully correct; 0 normalization failures; 2 model disagreements; 0 false overrides; 0 provider failures/retries; 0 silent missing\n- full v4: 106/108 fully correct (baseline 98/108); strict schema 108/108; 1 normalization failure; 1 model disagreement\n- original 98 correct-row regressions: 0\n- false overrides: 0; mark mismatches: 0; provider failures/retries: 0; silent missing: 0\n- initial finalization and two checkpoint-only reconstructions are byte-identical for all four compact artifacts; reconstruction provider calls: 0\n- tracked/external #1629 tree hashes and checkpoint hash are unchanged\n\nThe two unresolved rows remain fail-closed because their raw responses omit or misassign printed owners and the ownerless mark pass cannot safely create labels. Their exact visual and raw-response evidence is included in the final report.\n\n## Verification\n\n- 88 offline unit/fixture tests passed across issue #1620, #1621, #1627, #1629, and #1631 suites\n- Python compilation passed\n- JSON validation passed for every #1631 artifact\n- `git diff --check` passed\n- fresh targeted 10-row run completed\n- fresh full 108-row run completed\n- two fresh v5 checkpoint-only reconstructions completed after zero-call authenticated v4 rebinding with zero provider calls and byte-identical outputs\n\nThis repaired 108-question set is not an independent holdout. A new independent holdout is still required after repair; no follow-up holdout issue was created.\n\nCloses #1631","created_at":"2026-07-20T08:56:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T09:32:26Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T09:30:03Z","merged_at":"2026-07-20T09:30:03Z","merge_commit_sha":"de49902ad0e722ac75f56e8996c4ea7d9ef361be","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1634/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1634/comments","review_co